hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1538","We are Bundar, we are Muhammad bin Jafar, Shu`bah told us, he said: I heard Abdullah bin Al-Mukhtar speaking, on the authority of Musa bin Anas, on the authority of Anas Ibn Malik, “It was him and the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, and his mother and aunt, and the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, led the prayer with them, so he made Anas is on his right, and his mother and aunt are behind them.”"
